+  local comment
+  comment="<!-- llm-brain:claim host=$HOST -->
+The llm-brain fleet will work on this issue.
+
+Host: \`$HOST_NAME\`.
+Implementer: $(implementer). Reviewers: $(describe_reviewers)."
